  "description": "Unloved and unemployed, Laeyeon's only joy in life is the mobile game \"Salvation.\" After spending all hours playing the game, her body gives out. When she comes to, she's now Irel, a character in \"Salvation.\" As Irel, she can now enjoy things she never had: beauty, wealth, privilege, but most of all, unconditional love from her family. However, Irel is aggressively pursued by Barkan, a cruel, and extremely violent man who asks for Irel’s hand in marriage. She knows that in the game, Irel’s family rejects Barkan’s offer to protect their daughter. This will lead to Barkan slaughtering Irel’s entire family. Now Irel must do whatever it takes to change the narrative.\n\n(Source: Manta)",
